[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726681307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104176#issuecomment-2726681307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104176","id":2726681307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ihdrb","user":{"login":"viksl","id":33526847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTI2ODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33526847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl","html_url":"https://github.com/viksl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T14:44:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T14:44:08Z","body":"I can confirm on windows 11 at least.\nI don't have the dev symbols so can't see the errors but everything else is as reported above.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726681307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727554084","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104176#issuecomment-2727554084","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104176","id":2727554084,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikywk","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T17:29:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T17:29:44Z","body":"This is a fixed limit added in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97465\n\nThe limit could be configurable but unsure if this is actually a problem in real cases\n\nDo you have any real world examples where this many objects would actually be reasonable? The limit is 262144 total allocated RIDs, which is pretty huge.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727554084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734412157","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104176#issuecomment-2734412157","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104176","id":2734412157,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i-9F9","user":{"login":"cheyennix","id":47585766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTg1NzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47585766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix","html_url":"https://github.com/cheyennix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheyennix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T18:55:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T19:07:45Z","body":"> Do you have any real world examples where this many objects would actually be reasonable? The limit is 262144 total allocated RIDs, which is pretty huge.\n\nCurrently making a game with a large tilemap. The tiles are 80x80, and the map extends 300 blocks in each direction, so from -24000 to +24000 on the x and y axes.\n\nWe recently expanded to this size and it essentially breaks the entire game. Even when splitting up the tilemap in 4 separate chunks, well within the range for them, we get it cuz we're now breaking this RID limit. Because each cell on the tilemap is given an RID.\n\nI don't think this was accounted for when this change was made to 4.4. I feel like while this is an edge case, and is pretty much the only feasible way to trigger this issue, it is still a big deal. The tilemap documentation even explicitly points to the fact that the actual tilemap itself can have a max without wrapping of ~32768 on x/y in each direction, which in actuality due to this change, isn't even possible to achieve anymore.\n\nIf anyone has any ideas for workarounds in the meantime, that'd be great. It's affecting the editor as well. We aren't able to meet our vision as it stands right now, which is really unfortunate.\n\nSome errors:\n**Editor (no longer loads upon restarting):** \nERROR: Element limit reached.\nERROR: ./core/templates/rid_owner.h:296 - Parameter \"mem\" is null.\nERROR: modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_physics_server_2d.cpp:569 - Parameter \"body\" is null. (Printed, like, a trillion times).\n\n**Console @ runtime (does not load at all):**\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/096c1dce-1e44-4e8c-abbe-7a58fd050e28)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734412157/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2736418462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104176#issuecomment-2736418462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104176","id":2736418462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jGm6e","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.git